+/**
+  ******************************************************************************
+  * @file    Project/main.c 
+  * @author  MCD Application Team
+  * @version V2.2.0
+  * @date    30-September-2014
+  * @brief   Main program body
+   ******************************************************************************
+  * @attention
+  *
+  * <h2><center>&copy; COPYRIGHT 2014 STMicroelectronics</center></h2>
